{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["And he did not know — when fat was confused with suet and he ate it and did not know that there was forbidden fat here, but in the end when he heard that it was uncertain whether it was forbidden fat or suet that he ate. And he shall bring a ram without blemish from the flock as a guilt-offering. Until he knows that he definitely ate forbidden fat, he brings a sin-offering."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:18.719117859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}